  m_text: "Panel Flow.\nParticipant Details.\nGenerate Poster Prompt.\nGenerated
    Poster.\nRevise Poster. \nFinal Explanation. \nAI Score Calculation.\nLeaderboard.
    \n\nTips.\nSpeak clearly when using voice input. \nWait until the microphone
    has finished listening before speaking again.\nEnsure your device has an active
    internet connection for AI services. \nListen carefully to the poster description
    before submitting your final explanation. \nThank you for using Intelligent Inclusive
    Assistive Design. \nGood luck and enjoy creating accessible AI powered posters."
