  m_text: "Welcome to Intelligent Inclusive Assistive Design.\n\nAn AI powered poster
    creation platform designed to support blind and visually impaired participants
    in creating accessible posters independently.\n\nHow to use. \n\nStep 1. Enter
    Participant Details.\nFill in your name, institution, and competition category.\n\nStep
    2. Create a Poster Prompt.\nDescribe your poster idea using text or voice.\nThen
    press Generate Poster to create your AI generated poster."
